PROSECUTION EVIDENCE 4.In order to prove the guilt of accused, the prosecution examined the following seven witnesses:
 Sh. Arvind Kumar, the complainant and eye witness, deposed as PW-1;
 Ms. Laxmi, the eye witness and victim, deposed as PW-2;  Sh. Tavesh Kumar, the eye witness, deposed as PW-3;  Smt. Kiran, the eye witness, deposed as PW-4;

a. Person must be driving or riding on a public way;
b. He must be driving in a rash or negligent manner;
c. Likely to endanger human life or cause hurt or injury to any person 25.Section 338 IPC provide for the offences of causing grievous hurt by an act endangering life or personal safety of others.
